		{"id":"n-e221781f5e5b","type":"text","text":"# 07. AS-IS vs TO-BE\n\n| Reported AS-IS | Proposed TO-BE |\n| --- | --- |\n| Manual configuration | Governed templates |\n| Unclear evidence | Source-to-result trace |\n| KPI tree/report | Separate execution and effectiveness |\n| Unknown integrations | Validated source ownership |","x":4000,"y":1340,"width":1640,"height":720,"color":"3"},
