		{"id":"n-93b7b45dabf9","type":"text","text":"# 06. Root Cause Hypotheses\n\n**People:** ownership\n**Process:** lifecycle\n**Data:** source/evidence\n**System:** capability/integration\n**Governance:** baseline/roll-up\n\nHypotheses require verification.","x":2040,"y":1340,"width":1640,"height":720,"color":"2"},
